From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sm64ar <sm64ar@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] HUD, menus and screen scenes

2D parts of the game that the AR view shows as panels over the table:

- with a host hook, render_hud draws the host's HUD instead of the vanilla
  HUD body; text labels get their own overlay group, the screen-space cannon
  circle is not drawn, and the power meter stays at a fixed position;
- in story mode the file select, act selector and cake screen are a "screen
  scene": their real camera, vanilla culling and SCREEN tags, all inside
  overlay group MENU (gfx_ar_menu_scene). Everything else keeps the AR
  world rules;
- the race timer and the credits text are overlay groups of their own;
- while the host sets gArPipSky, a level's background node draws vanilla's
  skybox or fill colour again inside overlay group PIP, as the background
  of the intro's picture-in-picture.
---
 src/engine/level_script.c       |  8 ++++++++
 src/game/ar_game_hooks.h        |  2 ++
 src/game/area.c                 |  8 ++++++++
 src/game/geo_misc.c             |  2 ++
 src/game/hud.c                  | 14 +++++++++++--
 src/game/rendering_graph_node.c | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 src/game/screen_transition.c    |  2 ++
 src/pc/gfx/gfx_ar_hooks.h       | 15 +++++++++++++-
 8 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/engine/level_script.c b/src/engine/level_script.c
index 5735526..340b092 100644
--- a/src/engine/level_script.c
+++ b/src/engine/level_script.c
@@ -480,10 +480,18 @@ static void level_cmd_load_model_from_dl(void) {
     sCurrentCmd = CMD_NEXT;
 }
 
+static bool sArPermCommon = false;   /* AR: the common models (from Mario's on) went into the permanent pool */
 static void level_cmd_load_model_from_geo(void) {
     s16 arg0 = CMD_GET(s16, 2);
     void *arg1 = CMD_GET(void *, 4);
 
+    /* AR: in story the splash, title and file select run before level_main_scripts_entry, and their FREE_LEVEL_POOL
+     * already ended the permanent loads, so the common models (Mario, coins, stars; Mario's comes first) would go into the
+     * level pool and the grounds' ALLOC_LEVEL_POOL would drop them (Mario and the act selector's stars drawn without a
+     * model). Re-open the permanent loads for that first common block, until its own FREE_LEVEL_POOL. */
+    if (gArMode && gArStory && arg0 == MODEL_MARIO && sFinishedLoadingPerm && !sArPermCommon) { sFinishedLoadingPerm = false; }
+    if (gArMode && arg0 == MODEL_MARIO && !sFinishedLoadingPerm) { sArPermCommon = true; }
+
     u32 id = arg0;
     dynos_model_load_geo(&id, sFinishedLoadingPerm ? MODEL_POOL_LEVEL : MODEL_POOL_PERMANENT, arg1, true);
 
